# /catalog-import-merge writes PR bodies to data/{slug}/merge-pr-body.md
# (passed to `gh pr create --body-file`). Transient workflow artifacts —
# kept on disk for re-running gh pr create on failure or for debugging
# the generated body, but never catalog content.
data/*/merge-pr-body.md


